# Checksums of the SHARED headers — files that must be BYTE-IDENTICAL in every planet model
# (ATJUP, ATSAT, ATNEPT, and ATURAN as they arrive here).
#
# There is no submodule and no symlink holding them together: symlinks are not safe here, because
# Synology Drive has silently reverted a working tree once already, and a submodule costs
# workflow friction on every clone. So the copies are plain files and THIS manifest is what makes
# a divergence loud instead of silent. `make check-shared` verifies it.
#
# Editing a shared header means: edit it in one repo, copy it to the others, regenerate this
# manifest in ALL of them (keeping this header), and rebuild each.
#
# NOTE, and it is the reason to read this before trusting a green check: `make check-shared`
# verifies a repo against ITS OWN manifest. It cannot see two repos holding DIFFERENT copies of
# the same shared header — that state has already occurred once, and both repos reported OK. The
# only thing that catches it is diffing the SHARED.md5 files of the repos against each other.
# With four models that matters more than it did with two.
#
# TWO OF THE ELEVEN ARE HERE. ATPhys.h and ParaViewWriter.h arrived together with the shared
# ParaView writer. Still to come: BoundaryConditions.h, ConvectiveAdjustment.h, FluxLimiter.h,
# Turbulence.h, Precipitation.h, Radiation.h, PressureSolver.h, SaturationAdjustment.h and
# Reporting.h. This file was created EMPTY one commit before the first of them, so that the guard
# was never the thing added last: every header adds its line here in the SAME commit that copies
# it, and `make check-shared` has been green from before there was anything to check. It still
# reports the empty case in its own words, because an empty manifest and a passing one must not
# look alike.
#
# To add one: copy the header from ATNEPT (the most recently ported sibling), then
#     md5sum planet/<Header>.h >> planet/SHARED.md5
# and confirm the resulting line matches the sibling's entry for that file.
cb1c5d6d2a17ab71a3325c602833feb2  planet/ATPhys.h
52a7a800875443e2f8f3ebfe9506c6cd  planet/ParaViewWriter.h
97a14dd488fb7fd821f87905bff64eaf  planet/ConvectiveAdjustment.h
edf00eb9e4a480535cfd4d90339fa7ac  planet/FluxLimiter.h
5643f3828886f0ae0935dec27d002a70  planet/SaturationAdjustment.h
fc8734f6d8e2579b3045af094f4b12b4  planet/PressureSolver.h
f29ab46065a5379ae8db538e3c23b0bb  planet/Reporting.h
51330a5c2f63f3fd4a8248b5f4965e9c  planet/BoundaryConditions.h
7a5f2ed1c4687db310c07a573f717d0d  planet/Turbulence.h
035909ae5e2cb50eb682eb098761b782  planet/Radiation.h
